      "status": 200,
      "body": "\n  \n  \n<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/loose.dtd\">\n<!-- SpamCop::Web::Look $Revision$ produced by prod-sc-www02 -->\n<html>\n<head><title>SpamCop.net - Beware of cheap imitations</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Beware of cheap imitations!  SpamCop has been protecting the internet community since 1998.  Automatically file spam reports with the network administrators who can stop unsolicited email at the source.  Subscribe, and filter your email before it reaches your inbox.\">\n<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"SpamCop original spam cop email filter abuse header headers parse parser utility script net net-abuse filter mail program system trace traceroute dns\">\n<meta name=\"language\" content=\"en\">\n<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/images/favicon.ico\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/images/05look.css\">\n<link rel=\"alternate stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/images/xsmall.css\" title=\"XSmall\">\n<link rel=\"alternate stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/images/small.css\" title=\"Small\">\n<link rel=\"alternate stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/images/large.css\" title=\"Large\">\n<link rel=\"alternate stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/images/xlarge.css\" title=\"XLarge\">\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/js/script.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div id=\"logo\">\n<a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/images/05logo.png\"\n  alt=\"[SpamCop.net - protecting the internet through technology]\"\n  width=\"288\"\n  height=\"40\"></a><a\n  onclick=\"return !confirm('WARNING - do not send email or you will be blocklisted');\"\n  href=\"mailto:bait-14736695-6afa767e@good.julianhaight.com\">&nbsp;</a>\n</div>\n<div id=\"topmenu\">\n <a href=\"/help.shtml\">Help</a> |\n <a href=\"/sitemap.shtml\">Site Map</a>\n<div id=\"fontsize\"> | Text size:\n <a id=\"fontminus\" href=\"javascript:fontMinus();\">-</a>\n <a id=\"fontplus\" href=\"javascript:fontPlus();\">+</a>\n</div>\n</div><div id=\"login\">\n<form method=\"post\" action=\"/mcgi\">\n<div>\n<input size=15 type=\"text\" name=\"username\">\n<input size=8 type=\"password\" name=\"password\">\n<input type=\"submit\" value=\"Login\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"duration\" value=\"+12h\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"action\" value=\"cookielogin\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"returnurl\" value=\"/\">\n</div>\n</form>\n</div><div id=\"nav\">\n<a href=\"/anonsignup.shtml\">Report Spam</a>\n<a href=\"/bl.shtml\">Blocking List</a>\n<a href=\"/spamstats.shtml\">Statistics</a>\n<a href=\"/mcgi?action=loginform;returnurl=%2F\">Login</a>\n</div><div id=\"content\">\n\n<!--  This welcome page breaks the rules we like to enforce elsewhere:\n Inline style sheet\n Tables instead of div elements..\n--><style type=\"text/css\"><!--\n/* override the normal padded style from normal page template */\n#content {\n\tpadding: 0em;\n}\n--></style>\n<table border=0 cellspacing=0>\n<tr><td id=\"sidebar\" rowspan=2>\n<b>SpamCop is the premier service for reporting spam.</b>\nSpamCop determines the origin of unwanted email and reports\n it to the relevant Internet service providers.  By reporting spam, you\n have a positive impact on the problem.\n\n Reporting unsolicited email also helps feed spam filtering systems,\n including, but not limited to, SpamCop's own service.\n<p align=\"center\">\n<img src=\"/images/beware.png\" width=\"158\" height=\"113\"\n  alt=\"Beware of Cheap Imitations - SpamCop.net established 1998\">\n</td>\n\n<td class=\"column\">\n<h3>REPORT SPAM</h3>\n<p>Report spam to help Internet providers cut spam off at the source.<br>\n<a href=\"/anonsignup.shtml\">Register Now</a></p>\n\n<h3>USE FREE BLOCKING LIST</h3>\nUse the SpamCop DNS-based Blocking List with your own mailserver and get safe\n and effective spam filtering for free.<br>\n<a href=\"/bl.shtml\">Learn How</a>\n<br>\n<a href=\"/fom-serve/cache/297.html\">Legal / Technical description</a>\n<br>\n</td>\n\n<td class=\"column\">\n<h3>REPORTED FOR SPAMMING?</h3>\n<p>Find out about SpamCop reports and spam blocking, email deliverability\n problems and what you can do to ensure that your mail will get through.\n<br><a href=\"/reported.shtml\">Learn More</a></p>\n<h3>GET HELP</h3>\n<p>Get information from SpamCop's extensive FAQ and active user community.<br>\n<!-- Keep the above <br> against \"community\" to work around IE bug\n  which inserts an extra newline if there is any whitespace with some\n  screen widths -->\n<a href=\"/help.shtml\">Help Home</a></p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr>\n\n\n<td id=\"news\" colspan=2>\n<!-- <h3>NEWS:</h3>\n<strong>IronPort Settles Litigation with Optinrealbig.com</strong>\n<br><a href=\"http://www.ironport.com/pdf/ironport_2004-09-03.pdf\">\nPress release</a> (255K pdf).\n-->\n<h3>NEWS:</h3>\n<strong>Postmasters, please limit forgery blow-back:</strong>\n<br>\nDelayed bounces, virus notices, vacation messages\n<a href=\"/fom-serve/cache/329.html\">More..</a>\n</a>\n</td>\n</tr></table>\n\n</div>\n<div id=\"footer\">&copy;  <script>document.write(new Date().getFullYear());</script> Cisco Systems, Inc. All rights reserved.\n<a href=\"https://validator.w3.org/check?uri=referer\">HTML4</a>\n/\n<a href=\"https://jigsaw.w3.org/css-validator/check/referer\">CSS2</a>\n<a href=\"https://www.mozilla.org/firefox\">\n Firefox</a> recommended -\n<a href=\"/fom-serve/cache/400.html\">Policies and Disclaimers</a>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n\n\n\n\n",
